uTube@Apple）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174687208754778112697813.png/8GVik8HhG7HcSp9on8RZEe4IcQ8qonaq4vAGC-LwBgs\"/><figcaption>蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174687211263102976857921.png/Lh4w_fD_25Bf95lK4UCzxv7zgaEG4CgUoJj6M6CY-jM\"/><figcaption>蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174687218602610688465291.png/K6XZKm3FCLNB9iFXbY0zOSE_KlvfrbvZWvP3r1rz968\"/><figcaption>蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174687221203210240258397.png/iXyH5ubmc9f3DlpKExyKs8qp-S7z0okzzSXht80l4bc\"/><figcaption>蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174687223724118016145862.png/XGwcgESy6ZY9sxW5lWOCzig9NVMMW99pT0MrR09DK0c\"/><figcaption>蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174687226412797952763015.png/UABvJCkSbDI7ae3iHhMawgF_Sq-xL5DQncTY1J3E2NQ\"/><figcaption>蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260910/1174687229206335488829014.png/JwipnmfRfTwXNf7SkhSdHPRD0T79xZ67_ceNTP3HjUw\"/><figcaption>蘋果公司（Apple）推出首款摺疊式手機iPhone Duo，重量達254g。（YouTube@Apple）</figcaption></figure><p>影音／百萬人預約iPhone18！iPhone Duo夯爆　大陸黃牛代搶費46萬台幣</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T07:58:00.023903+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":3365,"images":26,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none"}}